y-based allocation or leverage added.","reporting":"Per asset and variant: return, wins/losses/flat, win rate, mean win/loss, holding time, drawdown, both directions, exit reasons, annual equity returns; remove top10 winners as arithmetic sensitivity. Compare each chosen chronological track and leave-one-asset-out track; show performance with best asset omitted. Nearby fast/slow alternatives are shown, not subsequently optimized.","stopping":"Exactly12 new configurations. No follow-up tuning after outcomes; preserve all failed versions and every executed trade. No claim that positive history guarantees future profitability or that every year must win. No live orders or automated follow-up."}
